      "writtenOn": "2025-05-20T18:26:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I like the change, but am hesitant to do it atm because Skia pins their emsdk version. My plan was to keep this pinned in Dawn as well until we migrate Skia to our pinned version, then ask further about making this updated based on hash. The main reason is because when I asked them about it, they said they had specific users that are using pinned versions of emsdk and needed things to work on those versions. I\u0027m not sure if anything has changed since then, but assuming not, I would want to hold off on this a bit until we get ok\u0027s from them. WDYT?",
      "revId": "4155e5a719e4b2ca4418c4cdc1d1827fc919477d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cc9f10e1_eeb19240",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-20T19:24:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We definitely want it to be pinned for stability, but it\u0027s still pinned by DEPS (emsdk is at 4.0.8 so `emsdk install latest` installs 4.0.8).\n\nWe can use a newer emsdk and install an older toolchain, but I don\u0027t think it\u0027s likely we\u0027ll ever need to do that.",
      "parentUuid": "2c49cea2_e4c4fac3",
      "revId": "4155e5a719e4b2ca4418c4cdc1d1827fc919477d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cc0a5705_bb709ecf",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-20T19:51:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that it\u0027s not THAT unlikely? I can imagine that eventually we set up a bot to autoroll `emsdk` into Dawn, but we would only manually roll the version at which point we would have a newer `emsdk` but potentially an older pinned version?\n\nIf we land this, then it would limit us in that we can\u0027t set up an autoroller for `emsdk` and only do manual rolls of it. Maybe that\u0027s fine? But I was hoping we could potentially leave the option open.",
      "parentUuid": "cc9f10e1_eeb19240",
      "revId": "4155e5a719e4b2ca4418c4cdc1d1827fc919477d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e7294737_928b1ce8",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
